6
00:00:38,910 --> 00:00:52,710
Rym: And I learned a few things that I hadn't really thought about before, because we went up to Rochester for a bunch of reasons, but because the actual center of totality went basically right over Rochester and Leroy, we could be directly under it.

7
00:00:53,630 --> 00:01:00,010
Rym: And I didn't realize how dark it gets under the actual totality, because I've never been under a totality before.

8
